DESCRIPTION >
    FROZEN ARCHIVE — do not ingest to this datasource.

    Pre-multi-tenancy data (no tenant_id). Ingestion moved to the _v2
    datasource of the same name; this is kept only so historical rows remain
    queryable and so `tinybird deploy` does not see a pending deletion.
    Deleting it requires --allow-destructive-operations and loses the data.

SCHEMA >
    timestamp DateTime `json:$.timestamp`,
    request_id String `json:$.request_id`,
    sensor_id String `json:$.sensor_id`,
    event String `json:$.event`,
    exposed_units Array(String) `json:$.exposed_units[:]`,
    unexposed_units Array(String) `json:$.unexposed_units[:]`,
    timers_scheduled Array(String) `json:$.timers_scheduled[:]`,
    timers_cancelled Array(String) `json:$.timers_cancelled[:]`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "timestamp, sensor_id"
